// unfold-scope — migrated from refiners.flow ruCheckerUnfoldScope(); this FILE takes precedence
// over the built-in fallback. One name per whitespace-separated token;
// '//' and '#' start comments. Curation rationale preserved below.

// elsymdif: (A∈(B△C)) ↔ ¬((A∈B)↔(A∈C)) — the △ membership unfold. The eq-rewrite
// refiner already maps csymdif→elsymdif (unfold.flow), but without it HERE the residual
// searches could never APPLY it — the 16 △-equality theorems of xboole_1 were unreachable.
elun elin eldif elsymdif velpw velsn noel elsn elpr eluni elint
mpbi mpbir sylib sylibr biimpi biimpri
